# Line endings are settled here rather than by each contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
# Without this, a clone on a machine with core.autocrlf=true checks every file out as CRLF,
# `git add` then warns once per file, and that warning alone is enough to fail
# create-scaffold-hbar's git-init step when someone scaffolds this template.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
